 --> 01:01:06.542 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 就是他？\n- 对\n\nN0919-0919\n01:01:06.625 --> 01:01:07.751 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（汽车发动）\n\nN0920-0920\n01:01:07.835 --> 01:01:09.461 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n真快\n\nN0921-0921\n01:01:21.223 --> 01:01:22.516 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n里奇，他要是进纽约市怎么办？\n\nN0922-0922\n01:01:22.599 --> 01:01:23.976 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n跟着钱走，就这么办\n\nN0923-0923\n01:01:24.059 --> 01:01:25.394 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们得盯住钱\n\nN0924-0924\n01:01:25.477 --> 01:01:26.895 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我们不能进纽约市\n\nN0925-0926\n01:01:26.979 --> 01:01:30.899 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n能，那可是我要负责的2万美元\n我不能让它丢了\n\nN0927-0927\n01:01:30.983 --> 01:01:32.442 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n超出我们的辖区了！\n\nN0928-0928\n01:01:32.526 --> 01:01:33.569 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n跟着钱走！\n\nN0929-0929\n01:01:33.652 --> 01:01:34.987 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n好，好，好！\n\nN0930-0930\n01:01:50.085 --> 01:01:51.378 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他靠边停了\n\nN0931-0931\n01:01:51.461 --> 01:01:53.547 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n好，开始吧\n\nN0932-0932\n01:01:53.630 --> 01:01:55.174 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n让我在这儿下\n\nN0933-0933\n01:01:56.341 --> 01:01:57.259 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（鸣笛声）\n\nN0934-0934\n01:01:57.342 --> 01:01:59.303 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n别走远，知道吧？\n\nN0935-0935\n01:01:59.386 --> 01:02:01.096 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我绕街区一圈\n\nN0936-0936\n01:02:01.555 --> 01:02:02.598 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n让开！\n\nN0937-0937\n01:02:37.591 --> 01:02:39.510 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n弗兰基，坐下！\n\nN0938-0938\n01:02:39.593 --> 01:02:41.011 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n什么？\n\nN0939-0939\n01:02:41.762 --> 01:02:43.972 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n生日快乐，先生们，怎么样？\n\nN0940-0940\n01:02:44.056 --> 01:02:48.101 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他要干什么？打保龄球？\n\nN0941-0941\n01:02:49.144 --> 01:02:50.521 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n瞧，全中了\n\nN0942-0942\n01:02:50.604 --> 01:02:51.855 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n两腿之间是什么？袋里装的什么？\n\nN0943-0943\n01:02:51.939 --> 01:02:53.649 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 没什么\n- 混蛋，站起来！\n\nN0944-0944\n01:02:53.732 --> 01:02:54.775 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n别闹了\n\nN0945-0945\n01:02:54.858 --> 01:02:56.235 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n闭嘴！我怎么跟你说的？\n\nN0946-0946\n01:02:56.318 --> 01:02:57.444 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n把头低下\n\nN0947-0947\n01:02:57.528 --> 01:02:58.612 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n闭嘴！这是谁的袋子？\n\nN0948-0948\n01:02:58.695 --> 01:02:59.696 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 你干什么？\n- 坐下，闭嘴！\n\nN0949-0949\n01:02:59.780 --> 01:03:01.323 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不许动！\n\nN0950-0950\n01:03:13.669 --> 01:03:16.129 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n伙计们！警官！\n\nN0951-0951\n01:03:16.964 --> 01:03:19.591 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我是纽瓦克的里奇·罗伯茨\n\nN0952-0952\n01:03:21.635 --> 01:03:23.178 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n那是我的钱\n\nN0953-0953\n01:03:23.971 --> 01:03:26.807 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n什么钱？你他妈说什么钱？\n\nN0954-0954\n01:03:28.183 --> 01:03:29.810 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这些钞票号码连续\n\nN0955-0955\n01:03:29.893 --> 01:03:33.105 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n埃塞克斯县检察署有登记，查一下\n\nN0956-0956\n01:03:33.188 --> 01:03:36.191 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n都是CF3500开头，看看\n\nN0957-0957\n01:03:41.572 --> 01:03:42.698 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他妈的，还登记了\n\nN0958-0958\n01:03:42.781 --> 01:03:46.243 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我还以为能买条克里斯游艇回家呢\n\nN0959-0959\n01:03:46.326 --> 01:03:49.454 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n误会而已，我拿回钱就走\n\nN0960-0960\n01:03:50.747 --> 01:03:52.833 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 这次就算了\n- 好\n\nN0961-0961\n01:03:53.458 --> 01:03:55.752 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n钱在这儿，好，谢谢\n\nN0962-0962\n01:03:55.836 --> 01:03:59.173 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我上次去新泽西是什么时候？想想\n\nN0963-0963\n01:04:00.757 --> 01:04:01.967 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n从来没去过\n\nN0964-0964\n01:04:03.969 --> 01:04:06.054 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你不打招呼就跑过来干什么？\n\nN0965-0965\n01:04:06.138 --> 01:04:09.183 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n就不怕受伤吗？\n\nN0966-0966\n01:04:10.267 --> 01:04:12.936 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n钱拿回去了，里奇\n\nN0967-0967\n01:04:13.937 --> 01:04:17.900 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n以后来这座城市，永远先打招呼\n\nN0968-0969\n01:04:17.983 --> 01:04:23.322 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n就算来看百老汇演出\n也先问问我同不同意\n\nN0970-0970\n01:04:24.907 --> 01:04:26.909 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n没问题，好\n\nN0971-0971\n01:04:30.621 --> 01:04:32.873 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 走，打球去\n- 西装不错，老兄\n\nN0972-0972\n01:04:35.834 --> 01:04:37.836 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n那是你的车？\n\nN0973-0973\n01:04:37.920 --> 01:04:39.671 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n车真他妈不错\n\nN0974-0974\n01:04:39.755 --> 01:04:42.633 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n祝你一路顺风，滚回新泽西\n\nN0975-0975\n01:04:42.716 --> 01:04:43.884 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n好\n\nN0976-0976\n01:04:43.967 --> 01:04:46.512 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我约好开球了，走吧\n\nN0977-0977\n01:04:59.149 --> 01:05:00.943 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这是你父亲？\n\nN0978-0978\n01:05:01.735 --> 01:05:03.779 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这是马丁·路德·金\n\nN0979-0979\n01:05:04.571 --> 01:05:06.490 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 才不是\n- 就是马丁·路德·金\n\nN0980-0980\n01:05:06.573 --> 01:05:08.075 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n就是“我有一个梦想”那位\n\nN0981-0981\n01:05:08.158 --> 01:05:09.451 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n当然知道\n\nN0982-0982\n01:05:09.535 --> 01:05:11.328 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不，他是…\n\nN0983-0983\n01:05:11.411 --> 01:05:14.998 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n对我来说，他跟金一样重要\n\nN0984-0984\n01:05:15.082 --> 01:05:16.959 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他做什么的？\n\nN0985-0985\n01:05:17.042 --> 01:05:22.589 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n做很多事，照顾纽约\n纽约也照顾他\n\nN0986-0986\n01:05:24.174 --> 01:05:25.926 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他是我的老板\n\nN0987-0987\n01:05:26.009 --> 01:05:27.553 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我的老师\n\nN0988-0988\n01:05:27.636 --> 01:05:28.971 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他教你什么？\n\nN0989-0990\n01:05:29.513 --> 01:05:35.769 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n很多东西，比如做事别急躁\n\nN0991-0992\n01:05:37.104 --> 01:05:41.817 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n要做一件事，就用心去做\n带着爱去做\n\nN0993-0993\n01:05:42.025 --> 01:05:43.402 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n还有呢？\n\nN0994-0994\n01:05:48.031 --> 01:05:49.908 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他教我做个绅士\n\nN0995-0995\n01:05:49.992 --> 01:05:51.660 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你是吗？\n\nN0996-0996\n01:05:51.743 --> 01:05:53.704 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我尽力，过来\n\nN0997-0997\n01:05:55.080 --> 01:05:57.165 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n来，坐这儿\n\nN0998-0998\n01:05:59.376 --> 01:06:00.752 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n看着我\n\nN0999-0999\n01:06:01.628 --> 01:06:04.715 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我在曼哈顿有5套公寓