--> 02:14:22.938 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（电视中的男子说话声）\n\nN2077-2077\n02:14:34.575 --> 02:14:36.451 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（女子尖叫）\n\nN2078-2078\n02:14:36.535 --> 02:14:37.870 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（狗叫声）\n\nN2079-2079\n02:14:40.747 --> 02:14:41.915 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（尖叫声）\n\nN2080-2080\n02:15:09.902 --> 02:15:11.820 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n喂，怎么回事？\n\nN2081-2081\n02:15:17.451 --> 02:15:18.952 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n搞什么…\n\nN2082-2082\n02:15:27.085 --> 02:15:28.253 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（闷哼声）\n\nN2083-2083\n02:15:31.381 --> 02:15:33.884 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n趴下！混蛋，别起来！\n\nN2084-2084\n02:15:33.967 --> 02:15:35.469 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n手！手！\n\nN2085-2085\n02:15:36.094 --> 02:15:37.721 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（咳嗽声）\n\nN2086-2086\n02:15:40.307 --> 02:15:42.017 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n本垒出局，宝贝\n\nN2087-2087\n02:15:42.100 --> 02:15:44.144 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（警笛声）\n\nN2088-2088\n02:15:45.521 --> 02:15:50.234 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（会众唱《奇异恩典》）\n\nN2089-2089\n02:15:53.278 --> 02:15:55.697 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 非常感谢\n- 不客气\n\nN2090-2090\n02:15:55.781 --> 02:15:58.325 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你们在这儿等，别走\n\nN2091-2091\n02:16:22.891 --> 02:16:25.519 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 卢卡斯太太，请进去\n- 好的，警官\n\nN2092-2092\n02:16:25.602 --> 02:16:26.937 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n卢卡斯妈妈，请进去\n\nN2093-2093\n02:16:27.020 --> 02:16:30.440 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n女士，失礼了，请进去，谢谢\n\nN2094-2094\n02:16:39.156 --> 02:16:40.157 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（警笛声）\n\nN2095-2095\n02:16:42.201 --> 02:16:44.162 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n手撑墙上，退后\n\nN2096-2096\n02:16:46.498 --> 02:16:47.624 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n天哪\n\nN2097-2097\n02:16:47.708 --> 02:16:50.710 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你不是欠我钱吗？再给你点，拿着\n\nN2098-2098\n02:16:52.504 --> 02:16:54.840 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n警察！小心！\n\nN2099-2099\n02:16:54.923 --> 02:16:57.009 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n纽约警察！全都不许动！\n\nN2100-2100\n02:16:59.844 --> 02:17:01.013 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n特纳！快跑！\n\nN2101-2101\n02:17:02.889 --> 02:17:05.017 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n狗杂种，趴在地上！\n\nN2102-2102\n02:17:29.249 --> 02:17:30.250 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（呼气声）\n\nN2103-2103\n02:17:39.092 --> 02:17:43.888 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n…从越南保卫祖国归来的阵亡军人…\n\nN2104-2104\n02:17:46.391 --> 02:17:49.477 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n那边，好\n\nN2105-2105\n02:17:50.102 --> 02:17:51.355 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（众人鼓掌）\n\nN2106-2106\n02:17:53.065 --> 02:17:54.691 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（法槌声）\n\nN2107-2108\n02:17:54.775 --> 02:18:01.156 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n女士们，先生们\n现在双方律师将作开庭陈述\n\nN2109-2110\n02:18:01.240 --> 02:18:06.745 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n控方罗伯茨先生先作陈述\n\nN2111-2111\n02:18:07.162 --> 02:18:11.083 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n罗伯茨先生，可以开始了吗？\n\nN2112-2112\n02:18:12.793 --> 02:18:14.460 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n可以，法官大人\n\nN2113-2113\n02:18:18.340 --> 02:18:20.968 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n陪审团的女士们，先生们\n\nN2114-2116\n02:18:25.305 --> 02:18:35.315 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n控方将证明，弗兰克·卢卡斯\n是这座城市街头最危险的人\n\nN2117-2117\n02:18:38.277 --> 02:18:42.197 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n都出去，让我单独跟里奇谈\n\nN2118-2119\n02:18:45.284 --> 02:18:49.538 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n快走，我按小时付钱\n不是按分钟\n\nN2120-2120\n02:18:51.498 --> 02:18:52.833 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n谢谢\n\nN2121-2121\n02:18:57.629 --> 02:18:59.548 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n没戴窃听器吧？\n\nN2122-2122\n02:19:00.674 --> 02:19:01.967 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n没有\n\nN2123-2123\n02:19:02.759 --> 02:19:05.679 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n好，我跟律师聊过\n\nN2124-2124\n02:19:05.762 --> 02:19:08.764 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们说了件事，我简直不敢相信\n\nN2125-2126\n02:19:09.683 --> 02:19:14.771 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你真在后备厢发现100万美元\n然后交上去了？\n\nN2127-2127\n02:19:14.855 --> 02:19:16.272 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你真这么干了？\n\nN2128-2128\n02:19:16.356 --> 02:19:19.735 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n老兄，真有你的，妈的\n\nN2129-2129\n02:19:19.817 --> 02:19:21.904 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不过你知道，钱被警察拿了吧？\n\nN2130-2130\n02:19:21.986 --> 02:19:23.989 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 也许吧\n- 没什么也许，里奇先生\n\nN2131-2132\n02:19:24.072 --> 02:19:28.994 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你知道他们拿走了，你把钱交上去\n却一无所得，对吧？\n\nN2133-2133\n02:19:29.076 --> 02:19:30.954 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n为什么这么做？\n\nN2134-2134\n02:19:31.038 --> 02:19:33.874 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 这是该做的\n- 没错\n\nN2135-2135\n02:19:33.957 --> 02:19:35.666 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n答得好，是该做的\n\nN2136-2136\n02:19:35.751 --> 02:19:37.960 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我一直在问自己一个问题\n\nN2137-2137\n02:19:38.045 --> 02:19:39.922 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n再来一次，你还会这样吗？\n\nN2138-2138\n02:19:40.923 --> 02:19:44.175 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n那么多钱，已经过去很久了\n\nN2139-2139\n02:19:44.259 --> 02:19:47.846 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你付了多少车贷，多少抚养费\n\nN2140-2140\n02:19:49.556 --> 02:19:51.475 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n所以我就想\n\nN2141-2141\n02:19:51.558 --> 02:19:53.435 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n要知道答案，只有亲自试试\n\nN2142-2142\n02:19:54.937 --> 02:20:00.943 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n贿赂、敲诈、谋杀、敲诈勒索犯罪…\n\nN2143-2144\n02:20:02.778 --> 02:20:08.033 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n给我个地址，保证有辆车停那儿\n保证后备厢里有钱\n\nN2145-2145\n02:20:08.116 --> 02:20:09.826 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不用，谢谢\n\nN2146-2146\n02:20:09.910 --> 02:20:11.078 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n确定？\n\nN2147-2147\n02:20:12.913 --> 02:20:15.832 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n里奇，你以为这能打动我？\n\nN2148-2148\n02:20:15.916 --> 02:20:18.669 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你觉得比别的警察高尚？并没有\n\nN2149-2149\n02:20:18.752 --> 02:20:22.130 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你跟他们一样，就是一路人\n\nN2150-2150\n02:20:22.214 --> 02:20:23.340 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n问你件事\n\nN2151-2152\n02:20:23.423 --> 02:20:28.554 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你真觉得把我关起来\n街头就会有什么变化？\n\nN2153-2153\n02:20:28.637 --> 02:20:30.180 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n瘾君子照样打针\n\nN2154-2154\n02:20:30.264 --> 02:20:32.516 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n照样为毒品偷窃，为毒品送命\n\nN2155-2155\n02:20:32.599 --> 02:20:35.727 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n抓不抓我，什么都不会变\n\nN2156-2156\n02:20:35.811 --> 02:20:37.020 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n那就如此\n\nN2157-2157\n02:20:37.104 --> 02:20:39.106 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n就是如此，那你有什么，里奇？\n\nN2158-2158\n02:20:39.189 --> 02:20:41.316 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你我坐在这儿\n\nN2159-2159\n02:20:41.400 --> 02:20:44.152 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n还有我弟弟那个告密的小司机\n\nN2160-2160\n02:20:44.236 --> 02:20:46.154 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n一点毒品\n\nN2161-2161\n02:20:46.238 --> 02:20:48.031 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这些还不够，里奇\n\nN2162-2162\n02:20:48.115 --> 02:20:51.159 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我有持有、供应毒品和共谋罪\n\nN2163-2163\n02:20:51.827 --> 02:20:55.747 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n还有贿警罪，有人能证明你冷血杀人\n\nN2164-2165\n02:20:55.831 --> 02:21:03.046 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你的离岸账户、房产、生意\n都是用海洛因的钱买的\n\nN2166-2166\n02:21:03.130 --> 02:21:06.008 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n还有几百个死去孩子的父母\n\nN2167-2167\n02:21:06.091 --> 02:21:08.594 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你的货让人过量致死\n我就这么跟陪审团说\n\nN2168-2168\n02:21:08.677 --> 02:21:12.389 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这样就能定罪：“他害死了几千人”\n\nN2169-2169\n02:21:12.472 --> 02:21:14.391 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n“住着顶层豪宅，开着林肯”\n\nN2170-2170\n02:21:14.474 --> 02:21:16.268 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n除此之外，你没什么可担心的\n\nN2171-2171\n02:21:16.351 --> 02:21:19.229 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n说得不错，所以才要上法庭吧？\n\nN2172-2172\n02:21:19.313 --> 02:21:20.898 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n因为我也有证人\n\nN2173-2173\n02:21:20.981 --> 02:21:24.985 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n有明星、运动员，还有整个哈莱姆\n\nN2174-2174\n02:21:25.485 --> 02:21:27.196 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我照顾了哈莱姆\n\nN2175-2175\n02:21:27.279 --> 02:21:29.364 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n它也会照顾我，你信不信\n\nN2176-2176\n02:21:29.448 --> 02:21:31.909 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 我还有更多，弗兰克\n- 有什么？\n\nN2177-2178\n02:21:31.992 --> 02:21:36.914 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n等着指证你的人，排出门口\n绕街区一圈\n\nN2179-2179\n02:21:36.997 --> 02:21:41.084 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你毁了很多人的生活\n马扎诺家族也愿意指证\n\nN2180-2180\n02:21:41.168 --> 02:21:42.794 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n记得他们吗？你抢光了他们的生意\n\nN2181-2181\n02:21:42.878 --> 02:21:44.296 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我跟马扎诺家族没关系\n\nN2182-2182\n02:21:44.379 --> 02:21:45.631 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们跟我也没关系\n\nN2183-2183\n02:21:45.714 --> 02:21:47.132 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 关系大着呢\n- 什么？他们…\n\nN2184-2184\n02:21:47.216 --> 02:21:48.800 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n- 知道为什么？\n- 为什么？\n\nN2185-2185\n02:21:48.884 --> 02:21:51.470 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不只是恨你这个人\n\nN2186-2186\n02:21:51.553 --> 02:21:52.888 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们还恨你所代表的东西\n\nN2187-2187\n02:21:52.971 --> 02:21:55.516 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我只代表弗兰克·卢卡斯\n\nN2188-2188\n02:21:55.599 --> 02:21:56.475 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n确定？\n\nN2189-2189\n02:21:56.558 --> 02:21:58.435 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n像你这样的黑人商人？\n\nN2190-2190\n02:21:58.519 --> 02:22:00.938 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你代表进步\n\nN2191-2191\n02:22:01.021 --> 02:22:04.191 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n会让他们损失很多钱的进步\n\nN2192-2192\n02:22:04.274 --> 02:22:08.195 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n除掉你，一切就能恢复正常\n\nN2193-2193\n02:22:09.279 --> 02:22:10.531 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n老兄\n\nN2194-2194\n02:22:15.077 --> 02:22:17.663 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n知道对我而言，什么叫正常吗？\n\nN2195-2195\n02:22:17.746 --> 02:22:20.832 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我6岁以后就没见过正常\n\nN2196-2196\n02:22:22.209 --> 02:22:24.795 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n正常就是看着警察到我家\n\nN2197-2197\n02:22:24.878 --> 02:22:27.840 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n把12岁的表弟拖出去，绑在柱子上\n\nN2198-2198\n02:22:27.923 --> 02:22:31.134 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n把霰弹枪塞进他嘴里，撞碎牙齿\n\nN2199-2199\n02:22:31.218 --> 02:22:34.471 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n再朝头上开两枪，把脑袋轰掉\n\nN2200-2200\n02:22:34.555 --> 02:22:36.139 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这就是我的正常\n\nN2201-2201\n02:22:36.223 --> 02:22:38.976 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n那时我就不在乎警察\n\nN2202-2202\n02:22:39.059 --> 02:22:42.062 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n现在也不在乎，妈的\n\nN2203-2203\n02:22:42.396 --> 02:22:44.690 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你想怎么做就怎么做\n\nN2204-2205\n02:22:44.773 --> 02:22:50.320 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n就算明早你被人打爆脑袋\n我也毫不在意，明白吗？\n\nN2206-2206\n02:22:50.404 --> 02:22:56.034 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n明白，排队吧，要杀我的人也绕一圈\n\nN2207-2207\n02:22:59.204 --> 02:23:00.581 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n好\n\nN2208-2208\n02:23:04.334 --> 02:23:05.878 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你想怎么做？\n\nN2209-2209\n02:23:12.342 --> 02:23:14.011 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你知道该怎么做\n\nN2210-2210\n02:23:14.094 --> 02:23:15.888 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n让我干什么？告密？\n\nN2211-2211\n02:23:15.971 --> 02:23:17.514 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你总不会想让我供出警察吧\n\nN2212-2212\n02:23:17.598 --> 02:23:19.850 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n想要黑帮？\n\nN2213-2213\n02:23:19.933 --> 02:23:23.520 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n随便挑，犹太帮、爱尔兰帮、意大利帮？\n\nN2214-2214\n02:23:24.438 --> 02:23:26.732 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们一下船就把哈莱姆榨干了\n\nN2215-2215\n02:23:26.815 --> 02:23:29.610 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我不在乎什么黑帮大人物\n\nN2216-2216\n02:23:29.693 --> 02:23:30.819 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n都给你\n\nN2217-2217\n02:23:31.737 --> 02:23:33.322 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们我也要\n\nN2218-2218\n02:23:33.405 --> 02:23:35.407 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n也要？\n\nN2219-2219\n02:23:40.454 --> 02:23:42.956 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n不会吧，你说的是警察\n\nN2220-2220\n02:23:43.040 --> 02:23:44.082 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你想抓警察？\n\nN2221-2221\n02:23:44.791 --> 02:23:45.792 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n抓自己人？\n\nN2222-2222\n02:23:45.876 --> 02:23:47.836 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们跟我不是一路人\n\nN2223-2223\n02:23:47.920 --> 02:23:50.255 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n他们跟你合伙，弗兰克\n跟我不是一路人\n\nN2224-2224\n02:23:50.339 --> 02:23:54.635 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n就像意大利人跟你不是一路人\n\nN2225-2225\n02:23:57.888 --> 02:23:58.972 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n哦\n\nN2226-2226\n02:24:08.232 --> 02:24:10.651 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你能保证什么，里奇？\n\nN2227-2228\n02:24:13.654 --> 02:24:19.076 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我保证，一个名字撒谎\n你就永远出不了监狱\n\nN2229-2230\n02:24:19.159 --> 02:24:24.331 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n离岸账户里哪怕一美元撒谎\n你也永远出不了监狱\n\nN2231-2232\n02:24:25.374 --> 02:24:32.756 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n要么余生带着财富坐牢\n要么穷着出来，过上几年自由日子\n\nN2233-2233\n02:24:33.674 --> 02:24:36.009 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我能保证的就是这个\n\nN2234-2235\n02:24:38.846 --> 02:24:49.189 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n我要那些从我口袋里拿钱的警察\n这才是我想要的\n\nN2236-2236\n02:24:52.317 --> 02:24:53.861 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n还有他\n\nN2237-2237\n02:24:53.944 --> 02:24:55.863 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n好，明白\n\nN2238-2238\n02:24:57.489 --> 02:24:59.992 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n斯皮尔曼？斯皮尔曼\n\nN2239-2239\n02:25:00.617 --> 02:25:03.245 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这些人都跟格温有联系\n\nN2240-2240\n02:25:03.328 --> 02:25:05.956 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n看这个，他穿着制服…\n\nN2241-2242\n02:25:06.790 --> 02:25:11.753 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n4名警员今日因涉嫌\n收受毒贩贿赂被捕\n\nN2243-2243\n02:25:11.837 --> 02:25:13.463 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n干得好，吉米\n\nN2244-2246\n02:25:13.547 --> 02:25:22.055 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n纽约缉毒警员的贪腐调查扩大\n今天又有19名警员被捕\n\nN2247-2249\n02:25:23.056 --> 02:25:31.148 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n这场全市最大的警界贪腐丑闻中\n又有32名警员被联邦法庭控以受贿罪\n\nN2250-2251\n02:25:31.231 --> 02:25:37.404 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n联邦检察官称，若被定罪\n这些警员将面临重刑\n\nN2252-2255\n02:25:37.487 --> 02:25:49.166 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n联邦调查报告称，纽约超过一半\n缉毒警员曾参与某种形式的腐败\n\nN2256-2258\n02:25:50.209 --> 02:25:59.843 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n精英特别缉毒调查组涉普遍贪腐\n更多纽约警探因此被捕\n\nN2259-2261\n02:25:59.927 --> 02:26:07.768 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n被判敲诈罪的纽约特别缉毒调查组\n成员今日将在联邦法庭接受量刑\n\nN2262-2262\n02:26:09.686 --> 02:26:12.606 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n麦克纳马拉，文达佐\n\nN2263-2263\n02:26:13.774 --> 02:26:15.108 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n特鲁波\n\nN2264-2264\n02:26:18.779 --> 02:26:19.863 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你很特别\n\nN2265-2265\n02:26:56.066 --> 02:26:57.276 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（呻吟声）\n\nN2266-2266\n02:27:03.407 --> 02:27:05.450 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n干得好，弗兰克\n\nN2267-2267\n02:27:06.410 --> 02:27:07.828 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n你知道…\n\nN2268-2268\n02:27:08.370 --> 02:27:11.999 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n要不要喝一杯，庆祝一下？\n\nN2269-2269\n02:27:12.082 --> 02:27:14.168 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n有圣水吗？\n\nF0009-0010\n02:27:16.211 --> 02:27:21.675 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n弗兰克·卢卡斯因合谋贩毒\n被判70年监禁\n\nF0011-0012\n02:27:23.218 --> 02:27:28.599 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n联邦当局没收其在美国及海外银行\n超过2.5亿美元的资产\n\nF0013-0014\n02:27:31.602 --> 02:27:37.983 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n弗兰克与里奇的合作，使纽约\n四分之三的缉毒局人员被定罪\n\nF0015-0016\n02:27:40.861 --> 02:27:47.159 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n弗兰克的30名亲属因贩毒\n被定罪入狱\n\nF0017-0017\n02:27:48.994 --> 02:27:53.081 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n弗兰克的妻子回到波多黎各\n\nF0018-0018\n02:27:54.291 --> 02:27:58.545 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n母亲回北卡罗来纳州居住\n\nF0019-0019\n02:28:00.422 --> 02:28:05.385 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n里奇辞去检察官职务\n转为辩护律师\n\nC2270-F0020\n02:28:08.055 --> 02:28:11.934 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（首位客户：弗兰克·卢卡斯）\n核对随身物品，请签名\n\nF0021-0021\n02:28:13.143 --> 02:28:16.396 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n因合作，弗兰克的刑期减至15年\n\nF0022-0022\n02:28:16.522 --> 02:28:18.815 align:middle line:0%,start position:50%,middle\n他于1991年获释\n\nN2271-2271\n02:28:25.239 --> 02:28:26.782 align:middle line:100%,end position:50%,middle\n（门锁蜂鸣声）\n";
